"""IT9 P4c-e: writes the two judged tables (edge_provenance_E.tsv, qualification_E.tsv) from the hand-entered judgements below (offline, deterministic).
  build_tables_E.py --help | build
The judgements are mine (Scientist-b4, 2026-10-30) and rest on the files named in each row: the OmniPath records (edge_records_omnipath.tsv), the full texts saved under
files/fulltext/ (ft_fetch_log.tsv: path and sha256), the Europe PMC abstracts (literature_abstracts.jsonl), ChEMBL (measures_*.tsv), the label extracts (exposure_E.tsv).
Reading depth words: FULL (whole body read, references not), PASSAGES (abstract plus the passages that carry the claim), ABSTRACT (abstract only), TITLE_ONLY.
Q-a: the record describes regulation of the SEED gene (or the intermediate named) in a cell relevant to the seed (neural / progenitor); Q-b: sign and level (transcript or protein) match
the network edge and the seed level; Q-c: the compound's action on its target is reported to change that readout; Q-d: target expressed in relevant cells and exposure known.
Answers: YES / NO / PARTLY / NOT_REPORTED / NOT_APPLICABLE, never inferred."""
